{"overview":"سوزوکی، دختری دبیرستانی عاشق، اما مردی که به او علاقه‌مند است، کاملاً متفاوت از اوست! در حالی که او شاد، برانگیخته و همیشه سعی در سازگاری دارد، همکلاسی‌اش یوسوکه تانی بی‌حس، ساکت و به نظر نمی‌رسد که به نظرات دیگران اهمیت بدهد. آیا سوزوکی می‌تواند اضطراب‌هایش را پشت سر بگذارد و او را دعوت کند، یا کشف خواهد کرد که مخالفان واقعاً جاذبه ندارند؟","tagline":"","overview_en":"Suzuki's a high school girl in love, but the guy she's fallen for is nothing like her! While she's cheerful, outgoing, and always trying to fit in, her classmate Yusuke Tani is stoic, quiet, and doesn't seem to care what people think of him. Will Suzuki be able to overcome her anxieties and ask him out, or will she discover that opposites really don't attract?","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":25,"y":2026,"poster":"/v7CyEzrBtw0STDK5ckNXlvw1Fap.jpg"}],"episodes":25,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"鈴代紗弓","role":"Miyu Suzuki (voice)","photo":"/7wEX0bXCs2djnp0dKsCqmMKZpZV.jpg","en":"Sayumi Suzushiro"},{"name":"坂田将吾","role":"Yuusuke Tani (voice)","photo":"/fRRPNBz3OCNRdmLdUTdpq7dGqxM.jpg","en":"Shogo Sakata"},{"name":"谷口夢奈","role":"Manami Watanabe (voice)","photo":"/zAiaPjmCilD3AhcTdDoGf2z1mUA.jpg","en":"Yuna Taniguchi"},{"name":"平林瑚夏","role":"Aoi Sato (voice)","photo":"/vTaOJ2cMUUcw2l6VarzLSbKACcQ.jpg","en":"Konatsu Hirabayashi"},{"name":"岩田アンジ","role":"Kentaro Yamada (voice)","photo":"/8YdsLlhXiVL1Qyn59HzbGubS2Fq.jpg","en":"Anji Iwata"},{"name":"島袋美由利","role":"Shino Azuma (voice)","photo":"/rjhyRM2hn1deQG1V6cwC8AEEKNT.jpg","en":"Miyuri Shimabukuro"},{"name":"加藤渉","role":"Shuuji Taira (voice)","photo":"/7PUe94Ju0klZfEutSSbdOJyaV0y.jpg","en":"Wataru Katoh"},{"name":"大森こころ","role":"Natsumi Nishi (voice)","photo":"/kWFIBZA39oPW9J2SM4OuZqw8u28.jpg","en":"Cocoro Omori"},{"name":"楠木ともり","role":"Rikako Honda (voice)","photo":"/iiGJPsLAnOoqmkNjLWCvbbDJw50.jpg","en":"Tomori Kusunoki"}],"trailer":"tCs7mtzrjpE","watc